  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height:normal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by virtue of its access, use and siting with lack of reliance on the main dwellinghouse no.102 Normanshire would not constitute ancillary accommodation. There are significant concerns that the structure could be utilised as a self-contained unit which would set an unacceptable precedent for backland form living that is contrary to directives of creating quality living spaces for existing and future occupiers. This is contrary to Policies 53, 56 and 57 of the Waltham Forests LP1 (2024). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br data-cke-eol=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
